		(descr "2x20 2.54 mm female socket for the Raspberry Pi GPIO header, for single-sided milled boards. Copper only on pins 1 (3V3), 3 (SDA), 5 (SCL), 14 and 34 (GND); every other pin is a bare 1.0 mm hole so the socket still fits. Place on the bottom side; solder on top.")
