		(property "Description" "2x20 2.54 mm socket that plugs onto the Raspberry Pi GPIO header, with only the I2C1 pins brought out: pin 1 3V3, pin 3 SDA (GPIO2), pin 5 SCL (GPIO3), pins 14 and 34 GND. The other 35 pins are bare holes in the matching footprint. GND pins 14 and 34 are joined inside the Pi."
